<title>USA: Laboratorio Chile Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Laboratorio Chile Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		 5.91		     2.41</p>
<p> Net		 1,866,922		762,296</p>
<p> Oper revs	 12,053,331	     6,752,840</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  n/a			n/a</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Chilean pesos.</p>
<p>Earnings per ADR were US$0.284 versus US$0.114.</p>
<p>The company reported first quarter net income in U.S. dollars for the first quarter of 1997 of $4.5 million compared to $1.8 million.</p>
</text>
